    WRITING and THINKING read their own collections newest-first, so
    publishing is what changes this page. Nothing here is hand-ordered.

    WORK is held back from launch: the section below is commented out, and so
    are the macro import and the `roles` set that only it used. The files it
    reads are ignored in eleventy.config.js, so uncommenting here on its own
    would put a bar over an empty list — lift the ignores at the same time.
#}
